The ECVRF construction in this package interoperates with the MIT-licensed
`VRF.sol` implementation published by SmartContract Chainlink Limited SEZC.

Copyright (c) 2021 SmartContract Chainlink Limited SEZC

The Solidity verifier is vendored at `contracts/vendor/chainlink/VRF.sol` and
retains its original SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT declaration. `operator/proof.mjs` is an
independent JavaScript port of the matching public proof-construction algorithm.

`contracts/vendor/randamu/BLS2.sol` and `Precompiles.sol` are pinned from
`randa-mu/bls-solidity` commit 11af179a8287d978659aae07adb66aa60f64b8a6.
They retain the MIT SPDX declaration and Copyright (c) 2025 Randamu. The single
`mcopy` operation was replaced with two non-overlapping `mload`/`mstore` copies
to preserve the project's Shanghai compiler target. The upstream project labels
this cryptographic code experimental and unaudited; it is not production-approved.

